{"id":"sintaxi-basica-de-css","title":"Sintaxi bàsica de CSS","topic":"css","topicLabel":"CSS","tags":["aprendizaje","css"],"course":null,"headings":[{"depth":2,"text":"¿Qué es?","id":"que-es"},{"depth":2,"text":"¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)","id":"como-se-escribe-sintaxis"}],"readingMins":1,"codeBlocks":0.5,"words":58,"html":"<h2 id=\"que-es\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Qué es?</h2><p>Una regla de CSS sempre té la mateixa estructura: primer tries a qui vols canviar l&#39;estil (el <strong>selector</strong>), obres claus i després escrius parelles de <strong>propietat</strong> i <strong>valor</strong> separades per dos punts i acabades en punt i coma .</p>\n<h2 id=\"como-se-escribe-sintaxis\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Cómo se escribe? (Sintaxis)</h2><div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">Css</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\">selector {\n  propiedad: valor;\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">h1</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">color</span>: darkblue;\n  <span class=\"hljs-attribute\">font-size</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">36px</span>;\n} </code></pre></div>"}